{"recordId":"general_完顏宗弼","name":"完顏宗弼","type":"general","dynasty":"遼夏金","title":"大金鐵壁","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"兀朮","pageId":107345,"revisionId":94525363,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-09-23T21:23:47Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%80%E6%9C%AE","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94525363","wikidataId":"Q836741","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"《御订全金诗增补中州集》","url":null,"type":"citation-template","template":"Cite book","author":"（清）郭元釪","publisher":"","date":"","isbn":"","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"岳飞传","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"补白","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"宋俘记","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"金史·卷七十七·宗弼列传","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"金史·卷四·本紀第四·熙宗","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"太祖實錄","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"宋史·卷二十六·本紀第二十六·高宗三","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"金史","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"宋史","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"大金國志·卷十九·章宗皇帝上","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"御订全金诗增补中州集","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"夷堅志·夷堅志補·卷十八","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[{"title":"金史/卷77","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%87%91%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B777","origin":"sister-template","retrieved":false}],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:35:04.997Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:songshi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:songshi-8ec203c29547558c","query":"完顏宗弼","count":1,"offset":6425,"excerpt":"書副京東運判杜時亮使金。\n\n時劉豫節制東平，丞相呂頤浩因致書豫。汝為行次壽春，遇完顏宗弼軍，不克與時亮會，獨馳入其壁，將上國書。宗弼盛怒，劫而縛之，欲加僇辱。汝為一無懼色，曰：「死固不辭，然銜命出疆，願達書吐一辭，死未晚。」宗弼顧汝為不屈，遂解縛延","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-35211f6e49ac022b","query":"完顏宗弼","count":1,"offset":10278,"excerpt":"。時李棁以戶部尚書董軍餉，陳邦光以顯謨閣直學士守建康，皆具降狀，逆之十里亭。金帥完顏宗弼既入城，棁、邦光率官屬迎拜，惟邦乂不屈膝，以血大書衣裾曰：「寧作趙氏鬼，不爲他邦臣。」宗弼不能屈。翼曰，遣人說邦乂，許以舊官。邦乂以首觸柱礎流血，曰：「世豈有不","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-9dfb6c637a9c597f","query":"完顏宗弼","count":1,"offset":11271,"excerpt":"唐佐在南京，守臣孟庾歸朝，以府事委之，唐佐遂降于金爲所用。唐佐雅善充，以書招之。完顏宗弼復遣人說充曰：「若降，當封以中原，如張邦昌故事。」充遂叛降金。事聞，高宗謂輔臣曰：「朕待充不薄，何乃至是哉？」下制削充爵，徙其子嵩、巖、崑、婿韓汝惟于廣州。\n\n","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":3,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:songshi-8ec203c29547558c","bookId":"book:songshi","requestedTitle":"宋史/卷399","title":"宋史/卷399","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%AE%8B%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7399","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2305892","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%AE%8B%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7399?action=history","revisionId":2305892,"revisionTimestamp":"2023-08-05T07:26:27Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:58:04.799Z","sha256":"782897c1c307a244c27c9c0c751bd713d2d7e4b6d537d7f9a2086007427e021a","textSha256":"fc0532a91b3c9ec929fbde73dc6864aa7c0e814c9